{"unit_id":"AtropinolTT__dsh-guide-dog#card-zh","repo":"AtropinolTT/dsh-guide-dog","commit":"fbd3a0584609722052710978214f8edceeb458a2","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Guide Dog for DSH 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的 MiniMax 多模态插件。它在 host 端注册工具，并通过 client 端把生成结果展示在对话卡片中，同时提供设置页、语音模式和通话界面。用户可以生成图像、视频、音乐和语音，调用视觉工具理解图片或检查界面，也可生成文本并搜索网页；语音输入支持麦克风录音和本地 Whisper 转写。适合希望在 DSH 会话中完成媒体创作、图像审阅和语音交互的用户。需要配置可用的 mmx CLI 与 MiniMax 认证；语音输入还需本地 faster-whisper 环境。","source":"generated","evidence":["bundle/lib/index.js:1280-1545","bundle/lib/client.js:1850-2010"]}
{"unit_id":"AtropinolTT__dsh-guide-dog#card-en","repo":"AtropinolTT/dsh-guide-dog","commit":"fbd3a0584609722052710978214f8edceeb458a2","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Guide Dog for DSH adds MiniMax tools to DSH web. It generates images, video, music and speech, reviews images, and searches the web. Result cards and a voice interface appear in the client. Requires mmx with MiniMax authentication; voice input needs a microphone and local Whisper.","source":"generated","evidence":["bundle/lib/index.js:1280-1545","bundle/lib/client.js:1850-2010"]}
